## Scenario

The Nexus community showcase. Wallpapers, CoreBox themes and plugin covers share one wall where people browse, favourite and rate them; opening a piece shows it large with its palette and variants, and anyone can drop in their own images to preview.

It fits image-first pages: a theme store, an asset library, a screenshot collection, plugin cover review.

